{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056230/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1760153270\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Embark on a daring journey in 'Cosmic Cargo,' a thrilling space adventure where you're the architect and captain of your own spacecraft. Carry cargo from station to station while fending off enemies and avoiding stellar hazards, using your spoils to upgrade your vessel into a formidable space fortress. Each run promises a thrilling path to becoming the ultimate cosmic courier in a galaxy teeming with risks and rewards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056230/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1760153270\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Modular, tile-based ship building</strong> that encourages creativity and requires strategy to ensure survival.<br></li><li><strong>Five main levels with three difficulty settings</strong>, and an endless mode that lets you test how far your ship can go!<br></li><li><strong>Face a wide variety of enemies and environmental hazards.</strong> You will face increasing risks - and rewards!<br></li><li><strong>More money means a bigger ship with more cargo and even more guns!</strong> With each successful delivery earn more for each cargo block your ship carries.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056230/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1760153270\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackg